WEBVTT

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:32.056
asking,

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.376
listening,

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.496
experimenting, reflecting,

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:39.000
striving and becoming?

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:43.136
What if we each always had something

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.680
we were working to improve?

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:48.176
What if we created more low-stakes islands

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.400
and waters?

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:52.296
And what if we got clear,

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:54.696
within ourselves and with our teammates,

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:58.256
about when we seek to learn
and when we seek to perform,

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:01.336
so that our efforts
can become more consequential,